# CCK-8

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-1
schema: 1
title: CCK-8
objective: compare viability
experimental_unit: well
factors:
  - name: treatment
    levels: [control, material]
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: g-control
schema: 1
name: Control
role: control
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: g-material
schema: 1
name: Material
role: treatment
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-cck8
schema: 1
title: CCK-8
endpoint: OD450
unit: AU
group_refs: [g-control, g-material]
timepoints: [D1]
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-seed
schema: 1
title: seed
assay: assay-cck8
timepoints: [D1]
path: root/seed
tasks:
  - id: task-seed
    title: 接种细胞
    kind: procedure
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-read
schema: 1
title: read
assay: assay-cck8
timepoints: [D1]
path: root/read
tasks:
  - id: task-read
    title: 读取 OD450
    kind: measurement
    readout: od450
checks:
  - checkId: custom-check
    title: 确认空白对照
    blocking: true
```

```asterlab
kind: workflow
id: wf-1
schema: 1
steps: [step-seed, step-read]
edges:
  - from: step-seed
    to: step-read
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: plate-d1
schema: 1
format: 96
assay: assay-cck8
groups:
  g-control: [A1, A2]
samples:
  A1: control-sample-1
  A2: control-sample-1
replicates:
  A1: 1
  A2: 2
```
